      "writtenOn": "2026-05-11T07:29:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The 2105 ms value is based on empirical measurement. In factory tests with new batteries, SBS data typically becomes available around 1.7–1.9 seconds after power-on. We chose 2105 ms as a conservative upper bound with margin to cover unit variation and EC scheduling delay, ensuring SBS is reliably ready before policy execution.",
      "parentUuid": "52aba43e_87e8173c",
      "revId": "b00b3fb7ea3b5d4542739f5b77b12d4207552f5e",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
