      "writtenOn": "2026-05-11T07:29:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The hook_call_deferred() in battery_policy_check() is a one-shot execution, and the deferred run happens after ~2s for SBS stabilization.\nAlternatively, we could consider adding a new hook at the battery wake-up stage, but it would require changes in common code, so we used a local deferred approach to minimize impact.",
      "parentUuid": "b0cbf651_c97cc23e",
      "revId": "b00b3fb7ea3b5d4542739f5b77b12d4207552f5e",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
